Cell["\<\
View 3 by 3 cells from above to see the repeating 120-degree magnetic \
pattern. There are twenty-seven atoms in this picture. CellRange changes how \
many cells are drawn, not the Hamiltonian:\
\>", "TechNoteText",ExpressionUUID->"4ebe05db-424f-427c-bd78-7357c2625b1e"],

