Cell["\<\
For the in-plane bands, keep the first three segments, Gamma-M-K-Gamma at kz \
= 0. Use the same path in the Brillouin-zone and band plots:\
\>", "TechNoteText",ExpressionUUID->"ecd21ddb-2c62-4f93-bad4-bcb86073960a"],

