Cell["\<\
Set e1 = 0 and t1 = -1 and plot the bands. The flat band has energy -2. The \
two dispersive bands meet at K at energy 1, while the flat band touches the \
lower dispersive band at Gamma. The energy unit is the magnitude of the \
hopping.\
\>", "TechNoteText",ExpressionUUID->"89f66de4-a95c-4e35-a53f-31e29827b440"]
}, Open  ]],

